OL,3,GNEWSA'No pressure of time' for jurors
OL,4,Ato reach verdict
OL,5,
OL,6,FA jury deliberating in a trial over a
OL,7,Ffatal gas explosion has been told there
OL,8,Fis "no pressure of time" to return a
OL,9,Fverdict.
OL,11,FTen people died following the explosion
OL,12,Fat Haut du Mont flats in Jersey in the
OL,13,Fearly hours of 10 December 2022.
OL,15,FGas workers Neil Armstrong, John Wright
OL,16,Fand Lee Ward deny 10 counts of gross
OL,17,Fnegligence manslaughter, while gas
OL,18,Fcompany Island Energy has pleaded not
OL,19,Fguilty to health and safety breaches.
OL,20,FJurors retired to consider a verdict
OL,21,Fearlier.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
