OL,3,GNEWSA'No pressure of time' for jurors
OL,4,Ato reach verdict
OL,5,
OL,6,FJudge Andrew Oldland told the 12 jurors
OL,7,Fit was about "holding people to
OL,8,Faccount" if the accused caused death by
OL,9,Fgross negligence, but he added: "No
OL,10,Fdoubt the defendants all deeply regret
OL,11,Fwhat happened."
